        "label": "Course design process"
      },
      "content": "<div slot=\"desc\"><p>A diagram of the five steps of course design. Select a step to learn more.</p></div><lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot hotspot-id=\"plan\" label=\"Design plan\">Collaborators agree on the course goals, the assessment strategy and the timeline.</lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot><lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot hotspot-id=\"outline\" label=\"Course outline\">The course is broken into modules and lessons, each tied to a goal.</lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot><lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot hotspot-id=\"proto\" label=\"Prototype\">One lesson is built in full so the approach can be tried and adjusted.</lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot><lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot hotspot-id=\"prod\" label=\"Production\">The remaining lessons are built following the prototype.</lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot><lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot hotspot-id=\"qr\" label=\"Quality review\">The finished course is checked for accuracy, accessibility and consistency.</lrndesign-imagemap-hotspot>"
